# The files that decide what counts as passing. A pull request that changes one
# needs a code owner's review before it can merge (the ruleset on `main`
# requires it). Everything else, including the recorded results that only move
# one way, is judged by CI and by `checks not weakened` (scripts/check-not-weakened.py).
#
# Order matters only in that a later line overrides an earlier one for the same file.

# CI, this file, and the rules agents follow
/.github/                                       @sam-xif
/AGENTS.md                                      @sam-xif

